    "displayName": "Search a XenoThreat Remote Outpost",
    "titleSource": "localized_clean",
    "titleConfidence": "high",
    "briefing": "Hi,\n\nGot a tough assignment here. There’s a small, satellite outpost near [Location] that needs to be investigated. I received intel that it’s housing some of our stolen supplies and sent [TargetName] to retrieve them. Haven’t heard anything from them in a while and am worried they ran into trouble.\n\nXenoThreat controls that location, but I hoped [TargetName] could slip in and out without getting noticed. Seems like that spot might be more heavily guarded than expected. Looking for someone to take a look and see what happened to [TargetName]. Also, if any of our supplies are found there, I need them taken to [Destination]. \n\nDo you think you can give it a shot? I’m guessing that the Xenos are entrenched there. Prepare accordingly and don’t expect them to make this easy on you.  \n\nThanks, \n\nLima Endicott\nLead Dispatcher\nCitizens for Prosperity",
